    "description": "UCL Student Union Additional Risk Assessment Form: submitted by a president or treasurer for any new or one-off activity not covered by the core risk assessment, large-scale activities involving the public, anything involving an overnight stay or substantial travel, or when the Student Activities team asks. Reviewed case by case, at least 10 working days before the activity; activity outside the UK mainland must be registered at least 8 weeks ahead. Trips with overnight stays must complete the overnight stay and participant details sections. The risk assessment itself is an uploaded spreadsheet (one xls, xlsx or xml file, 2 MB limit). Reached from /forms/additional-risk-assessment-submission, which redirects here. Incidents are reported separately on UCL riskNET.",
